dwgread.exe and the DLLs next to it (libredwg-0.dll, libiconv-2.dll,
libpcre2-*.dll) are unmodified files from the official Windows release of GNU
LibreDWG @DWGCHECK_LIBREDWG_VERSION@:
  https://github.com/LibreDWG/libredwg/releases/tag/@DWGCHECK_LIBREDWG_VERSION@

LibreDWG is Copyright (C) Free Software Foundation, Inc., licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any later version
(GPL-3.0.txt). Its source code is the release
  @DWGCHECK_LIBREDWG_URL@
  SHA-256 @DWGCHECK_LIBREDWG_SHA256@
DWG Checker runs dwgread as a separate program to read DWG files.

libiconv (GNU LGPL) and PCRE2 (BSD) come with that release; their license texts
are not included here. This is a local build: the packages that CI builds use a
dwgread built from source, without these DLLs.
